  characterName: Ninomae Arisa
  description: She's always trying to stay true to herself no matter what, even if
    it makes herself look a little too serious sometimes. Lightening up isn't easy
    for her, but as Takasu Mitsuko's best friend, she tries to become someone more
    fun to be around. At the same time, she helps Mitsuko keep her head out of the
    clouds.
